{"seq":3,"slug":"visual-regression-testing","title":"视觉回归测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/testing-strategy/visual-regression-testing","wordCount":522,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"视觉回归测试\">视觉回归测试</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>功能测试验证&quot;代码做了什么&quot;，视觉回归测试验证&quot;页面看起来是否正确&quot;。一次看似无害的 CSS 修改可能导致页面布局错位、字体大小异常或间距丢失——这些问题在功能测试中完全无法被捕获。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    CHANGE[代码变更&lt;br/&gt;修改了 CSS] --&gt; FUNC[功能测试&lt;br/&gt;✅ 全部通过]&#10;    CHANGE --&gt; VISUAL[视觉回归测试&lt;br/&gt;❌ 发现 UI 差异]&#10;    FUNC --&gt; DEPLOY[部署上线]&#10;    VISUAL --&gt; FIX[修复或确认]&#10;    FIX --&gt; DEPLOY\">graph LR\n    CHANGE[代码变更&lt;br/&gt;修改了 CSS] --&gt; FUNC[功能测试&lt;br/&gt;✅ 全部通过]\n    CHANGE --&gt; VISUAL[视觉回归测试&lt;br/&gt;❌ 发现 UI 差异]\n    FUNC --&gt; DEPLOY[部署上线]\n    VISUAL --&gt; FIX[修复或确认]\n    FIX --&gt; DEPLOY</pre><p>视觉回归测试的核心原理：对比当前渲染结果与基准截图（baseline），自动检测像素级差异。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基于-playwright-的视觉测试\">基于 Playwright 的视觉测试</h2><p>Playwright 内置了截图对比功能，无需额外工具即可实现基础的视觉回归测试。</p>\n<h3 id=\"配置\">配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// playwright.config.ts&#10;import { defineConfig } from &#39;@playwright/test&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  testDir: &#39;./e2e&#39;,&#10;  snapshotDir: &#39;./e2e/__snapshots__&#39;,&#10;  snapshotPathTemplate: &#39;{snapshotDir}/{testFilePath}/{arg}{ext}&#39;,&#10;  expect: {&#10;    toHaveScreenshot: {&#10;      maxDiffPixels: 50,&#10;      maxDiffPixelRatio: 0.01,&#10;      threshold: 0.2,&#10;      animations: &#39;disabled&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  use: {&#10;    baseURL: &#39;http://localhost:3000&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// playwright.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@playwright/test'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  testDir: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./e2e'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  snapshotDir: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./e2e/__snapshots__'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  snapshotPathTemplate: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{snapshotDir}/{testFilePath}/{arg}{ext}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expect: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    toHaveScreenshot: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      maxDiffPixels: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      maxDiffPixelRatio: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-da